{"page":279,"verses":[{"verse_key":"16:103","surah":16,"ayah":103,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ نَعْلَمُ أَنَّهُمْ يَقُولُونَ إِنَّمَا يُعَلِّمُهُۥ بَشَرٌ ۗ لِّسَانُ ٱلَّذِى يُلْحِدُونَ إِلَيْهِ أَعْجَمِىٌّ وَهَـٰذَا لِسَانٌ عَرَبِىٌّ مُّبِينٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We know very well that they say, ‘It is a man who teaches him,’ but the language of the person they allude to is foreign, while this revelation is in clear Arabic.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"16:103"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"We know","transliteration":"naʿlamu","verse_key":"16:103"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"that they","transliteration":"annahum","verse_key":"16:103"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَقُولُونَ","en_gloss":"say","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","verse_key":"16:103"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"16:103"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُعَلِّمُهُۥ","en_gloss":"teaches him","transliteration":"yuʿallimuhu","verse_key":"16:103"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَشَرٌۭ ۗ","en_gloss":"a human being","transliteration":"basharun","verse_key":"16:103"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِّسَانُ","en_gloss":"(The) tongue","transliteration":"lisānu","verse_key":"16:103"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(of) the one","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"16:103"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يُلْحِدُونَ","en_gloss":"they refer","transliteration":"yul'ḥidūna","verse_key":"16:103"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"to him","transliteration":"ilayhi","verse_key":"16:103"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَعْجَمِىٌّۭ","en_gloss":"(is) foreign","transliteration":"aʿjamiyyun","verse_key":"16:103"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَهَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"while this","transliteration":"wahādhā","verse_key":"16:103"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لِسَانٌ","en_gloss":"(is) a language","transliteration":"lisānun","verse_key":"16:103"},{"pos":15,"ar":"عَرَبِىٌّۭ","en_gloss":"Arabic","transliteration":"ʿarabiyyun","verse_key":"16:103"},{"pos":16,"ar":"مُّبِينٌ","en_gloss":"clear","transliteration":"mubīnun","verse_key":"16:103"},{"pos":17,"ar":"١٠٣","en_gloss":"(103)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:103"}]},{"verse_key":"16:104","surah":16,"ayah":104,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِـَٔايَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ لَا يَهْدِيهِمُ ٱللَّهُ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If people do not believe in God’s revelation, God does not guide them, and a painful punishment awaits them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"16:104"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"16:104"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"16:104"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"16:104"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"in the Verses","transliteration":"biāyāti","verse_key":"16:104"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"16:104"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"16:104"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَهْدِيهِمُ","en_gloss":"Allah will guide them","transliteration":"yahdīhimu","verse_key":"16:104"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah will guide them","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"16:104"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and for them","transliteration":"walahum","verse_key":"16:104"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَذَابٌ","en_gloss":"(is) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"16:104"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَلِيمٌ","en_gloss":"painful","transliteration":"alīmun","verse_key":"16:104"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٠٤","en_gloss":"(104)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:104"}]},{"verse_key":"16:105","surah":16,"ayah":105,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا يَفْتَرِى ٱلْكَذِبَ ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِـَٔايَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ ۖ وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْكَـٰذِبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Falsehood is fabricated only by those who do not believe in God’s revelation: they are the liars.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"16:105"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَفْتَرِى","en_gloss":"they invent","transliteration":"yaftarī","verse_key":"16:105"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْكَذِبَ","en_gloss":"the falsehood","transliteration":"l-kadhiba","verse_key":"16:105"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"16:105"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"16:105"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"16:105"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"in the Verses","transliteration":"biāyāti","verse_key":"16:105"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"16:105"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"and those ","transliteration":"wa-ulāika","verse_key":"16:105"},{"pos":10,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"16:105"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰذِبُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) the liars","transliteration":"l-kādhibūna","verse_key":"16:105"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٠٥","en_gloss":"(105)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:105"}]},{"verse_key":"16:106","surah":16,"ayah":106,"ar_uthmani":"مَن كَفَرَ بِٱللَّهِ مِنۢ بَعْدِ إِيمَـٰنِهِۦٓ إِلَّا مَنْ أُكْرِهَ وَقَلْبُهُۥ مُطْمَئِنٌّۢ بِٱلْإِيمَـٰنِ وَلَـٰكِن مَّن شَرَحَ بِٱلْكُفْرِ صَدْرًا فَعَلَيْهِمْ غَضَبٌ مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"With the exception of those who are forced to say they do not believe, although their hearts remain firm in faith, those who reject God after believing in Him and open their hearts to disbelief will have the wrath of God upon them and a grievous punishment awaiting them.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"Whoever","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"16:106"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَفَرَ","en_gloss":"disbelieves","transliteration":"kafara","verse_key":"16:106"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِٱللَّه