nt","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"16:106"},{"pos":24,"ar":"عَظِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"great","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","verse_key":"16:106"},{"pos":25,"ar":"١٠٦","en_gloss":"(106)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:106"}]},{"verse_key":"16:107","surah":16,"ayah":107,"ar_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ بِأَنَّهُمُ ٱسْتَحَبُّوا۟ ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنْيَا عَلَى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ وَأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يَهْدِى ٱلْقَوْمَ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"This is because they love the life of this world more than the one to come, and God does not guide those who reject Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That (is)","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"16:107"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِأَنَّهُمُ","en_gloss":"because","transliteration":"bi-annahumu","verse_key":"16:107"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱسْتَحَبُّوا۟","en_gloss":"they preferred","transliteration":"is'taḥabbū","verse_key":"16:107"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ","en_gloss":"the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayata","verse_key":"16:107"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"16:107"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"16:107"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","verse_key":"16:107"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَأَنَّ","en_gloss":"and that","transliteration":"wa-anna","verse_key":"16:107"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"16:107"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(does) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"16:107"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَهْدِى","en_gloss":"guide","transliteration":"yahdī","verse_key":"16:107"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-qawma","verse_key":"16:107"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"the disbelievers","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","verse_key":"16:107"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١٠٧","en_gloss":"(107)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:107"}]},{"verse_key":"16:108","surah":16,"ayah":108,"ar_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ ٱلَّذِينَ طَبَعَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِهِمْ وَسَمْعِهِمْ وَأَبْصَـٰرِهِمْ ۖ وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْغَـٰفِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"These are people whose hearts, hearing, and sight have been closed off by God: they are heedless,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"16:108"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(are) the ones ","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"16:108"},{"pos":3,"ar":"طَبَعَ","en_gloss":"Allah has set a seal","transliteration":"ṭabaʿa","verse_key":"16:108"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah has set a seal","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"16:108"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"16:108"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قُلُوبِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbihim","verse_key":"16:108"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَسَمْعِهِمْ","en_gloss":"and their hearing","transliteration":"wasamʿihim","verse_key":"16:108"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَأَبْصَـٰرِهِمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"and their sight","transliteration":"wa-abṣārihim","verse_key":"16:108"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"And those ","transliteration":"wa-ulāika","verse_key":"16:108"},{"pos":10,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"they are","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"16:108"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْغَـٰفِلُونَ","en_gloss":"the heedless","transliteration":"l-ghāfilūna","verse_key":"16:108"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٠٨","en_gloss":"(108)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:108"}]},{"verse_key":"16:109","surah":16,"ayah":109,"ar_uthmani":"لَا جَرَمَ أَنَّهُمْ فِى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ هُمُ ٱلْخَـٰسِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and there is no doubt that they will be the losers in the Hereafter.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"No","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"16:109"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَرَمَ","en_gloss":"doubt","transliteration":"jarama","verse_key":"16:109"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"that they","transliteration":"an